{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o092b","title":"袁尚再攻袁谭与曹操围邺","time":{"label":"建安九年二月","year":204,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q","wudi-q-o092","wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4"],"chronology":"wudi-y204","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o092","basis":"建安九年二月","reviewed":true}},"order":218,"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"出攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"被攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0207","role":"投降","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"守邺","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"围城","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0209","role":"屯兵通粮","evidence":["wudi-e-o092b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0122","role":"进围邺城","evidence":["chengguo-q-3dd3a1390375a0b1eaee"]},{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"与尚议所遣","evidence":["liusima-q-4e4e9578692fd04fae52"]},{"person":"wudi-p0237","role":"从围邺","evidence":["lizang-q-87d8343c262aebe7d2dc"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0015","role":"从围邺力战赐爵关内侯","evidence":["lizang-q-5f35228d0fe3ed7cf018"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o250","title":"李孚请自往，将三骑入邺，尚从其计","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},"order":3369,"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"答尚今使小人往恐不足以知外内且恐不能自达，请自往；闻邺围甚坚多人则觉，以为直当将三骑足矣；自选温信者三人，不语所之，皆敕使具脯粮不得持兵杖，各给快马；辞尚来南，所在止亭传；及到梁淇，使从者斫问事杖三十枚系著马边，自著平上帻，将三骑，投暮诣邺下；因刍牧者多夜到，以鼓一中自称都督，历北围循表而东，从东围表又循围而南，步步呵责守围将士，随轻重行其罚；历太祖营前径南过，从南围角西折当章门，复责怒守围者收缚之，因开其围驰到城下，呼城上人，城上人以绳引得入；得入邺城","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"问孚当何所得，从其计","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"等见孚悲喜，鼓噪称万岁","evidence":["liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"守围者以状闻，笑曰此非徒得入也，方且复得出","evidence":["liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o251","title":"李孚请配驱老弱出降以省谷，配从之","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","liusima-q-04d06b0e182d989ad8a7","liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8","liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319"]},"order":3370,"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"使命当速反，度外围必急不可复冒，乃阴心计请配曰今城中谷少，无用老弱为也，不如驱出之以省谷；无何将本所从，作降人服，随辈夜出，出北门，遂从西北角突围得去；已得出围；比见尚","evidence":["liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","liusima-q-04d06b0e182d989ad8a7","liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8","liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"从其计，乃复夜简别得数千人，皆使持白幡，从三门并出降","evidence":["liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"闻孚已得出，抵掌笑曰果如吾言也","evidence":["liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"甚欢喜","evidence":["liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o252","title":"尚不能救邺破走中山，谭追击，孚与尚相失诣谭复为主簿","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173"]},"order":3371,"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"不能救邺，破走至中山，又走","evidence":["liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173"]},{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"追击尚","evidence":["liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173"]},{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"与尚相失，遂诣谭，复为谭主簿，东还平原","evidence":["liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o254","title":"李孚骑诣牙门自称冀州主簿欲口白密事，得见太祖","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d"]},"order":3372,"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"还城后权宜欲得见太祖，乃骑诣牙门，称冀州主簿李孚欲口白密事，见之叩头谢；言今城中强弱相陵心皆不定，宜令新降为内所识信者宣传明教；跪请教，还入城宣教各安故业不得相侵陵，城中以安，乃还报命","evidence":["liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"见之；谓孚卿便还宣之，又曰便以卿意宣也","evidence":["liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d"]}],"accounts":[]}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0035","name":"李孚","evidence":["liusima-q-4e4e9578692fd04fae52","liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e","liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","liusima-q-04d06b0e182d989ad8a7","liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8","liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319","liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173","liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d","liusima-q2-b7e2fc6eed28bd7dba17"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-74c663fbd0d6305aea07","text":"《魏略》记初为袁尚主簿；后自冗散为解长，稍迁司隶校尉、阳平太守；本姓冯。","evidence":["liusima-q2-b7e2fc6eed28bd7dba17"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
